            "target_entity_instance": "Farquhar et al. mechanistic photosynthesis model",
            "target_entity_type": "PhysicalScheme",
            "paragraph": "The mechanistic photosynthesis model proposed by Farquhar et al.52 successfully captures the biochemical controls of leaf photosynthesis and responses to variations in temperature, light and CO2 concentration.",
